Thought: I need to screen 100 candidate studies for inclusion/exclusion based on the selection criteria for a systematic
review about DDAVP use in surgery. The criteria specify: randomised controlled trials comparing DDAVP to placebo or     
active comparator, before/during/immediately after surgery or invasive procedures, in adults or children.               
                                                                                                                        
Let me use the batch_screen_studies tool to prepare all studies for screening.                                          
                                                                                                                        
